    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741310/extras/fa0a871d7d55748d81d4a45eab08a6db.avif?t=1751049587\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TU VECINA<strong>:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hentai game and visual novel</strong> where you step into the rugged, solitary life of a mountain man. One day, fate\u2014<i>and maybe a short circuit</i>\u2014causes your neighbor\u2019s house, whom you've known for over 20 years, to burn down. Desperate and homeless, she turns to you for help... You, ever the gentleman (<i>with not-so-innocent intentions</i>), offer her indefinite shelter in your cabin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's up to you to win her heart\u2014<i>and more</i>\u2014while working as a lumberjack, chopping trees to earn money, feed her, and keep her from dying of hunger... or boredom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seduce her little by little, and experience a story full of steamy moments, awkward situations, and lots of sex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All characters depicted are over 20 years old.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content warning!</strong> This game contains: oral sex, sexual acts, inappropriate language, lewd behavior, and voyeurism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the story via dialogues and choices that increase your guest\u2019s affection and arousal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741310/extras/84b1941dd146e0a343870b6811ddd7f9.avif?t=1751049587\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741310/ex